/**
 * Pacten Standard Transaction Agreement — template text, transcribed
 * VERBATIM from the client-supplied document (~/workspace/user/files/
 * PACTEN.docx, 15 sections, 96 bracketed placeholders). Do not edit the
 * wording: only field substitution may change the rendered output.
 * The template is snapshotted onto each generated contract
 * (templateSnapshot), so later edits never rewrite signed agreements.
 * Recorded electronic acceptance only — no drawn signatures and no
 * third-party e-signature integration (excluded from the agreement).
 */

